00:01:39.736 --> 00:01:42.402
♫ Try to trust in your friends

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:45.398
♫ One at a time

00:01:45.398 --> 00:01:49.189
♫ It's the best thing to do

00:01:51.809 --> 00:01:54.748
♫ If you lean on a buddy

00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:59.422
♫ Who's twice as good for you

00:02:03.062 --> 00:02:04.126
♫ For you ♫

00:02:04.126 --> 00:02:05.094
- This whomps.

00:02:06.694 --> 00:02:08.807
Run. Run run run run run!

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.604
(hockey stick hits ground)

00:02:11.604 --> 00:02:15.650
(fast paced rock music)

00:02:27.943 --> 00:02:28.936
- Hey Daria.

00:02:31.113 --> 00:02:32.161
- [Quinn] But moooommm...

00:02:32.161 --> 00:02:33.653
Daria's walking into my shot and

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.277
I don't want to be seen with her.

00:02:35.277 --> 00:02:38.542
(slow paced rock music)

00:02:42.799 --> 00:02:44.004
- Hey babe!

00:02:56.891 --> 00:03:00.839
(fast techno music)

00:03:17.627 --> 00:03:18.784
(all three yell)

00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:20.924
- Oh no, it's raining!

00:03:20.924 --> 00:03:21.878
(Misty cries)

00:03:21.878 --> 00:03:25.002
- Hey I know, I'll use
my trusty frying pan

00:03:25.002 --> 00:03:27.495
as a drying pan!

00:03:27.495 --> 00:03:28.981
(groans)

00:03:29.892 --> 00:03:31.799
Oh hey Nurse Joy, let's get married!

00:03:31.799 --> 00:03:34.142
Please, give me a Chansey!

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.682
- [Helga] Arnold...

00:03:38.177 --> 00:03:41.860
(fast jazz music)

00:03:59.162 --> 00:04:02.332
Arnold... Arnold...

00:04:02.332 --> 00:04:03.455
Hey Arnold!

00:04:20.535 --> 00:04:22.105
Move it Football Head!

00:04:25.612 --> 00:04:28.189
Oh, my sweet, sweet love.

00:04:28.189 --> 00:04:28.792
(bicycle bell)

00:04:30.342 --> 00:04:31.862
(Eugene moans)

00:04:31.862 --> 00:04:33.907
(crashing noise)

00:04:33.907 --> 00:04:35.240
- [Eugene] I'm okay.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:37.997
- Daria, smile!

00:04:37.997 --> 00:04:40.701
- I don't like to smile
unless I have a reason.

00:04:42.391 --> 00:04:44.668
- [Quinn] It's too bad
Sandy couldn't make it.

00:04:44.668 --> 00:04:45.792
Say cheese!

00:04:45.792 --> 00:04:47.457
- [Group] Cheese.

00:04:47.457 --> 00:04:51.084
(Acapella music)

